    <row>
        <cell>Maui begins working at Macy's.  She will be paid a daily amount plus a commission of her total sales.  The equation <m>P(s)=0.10s+15</m> represents the amount Maui will make based on her total sales where <m>P</m> is the amount of money she makes in one day, and <m>s</m> is her total sales.  How much will Maui make if she sells $650?                                       </cell>
