    </row>
    <row>
        <cell>Alejandra paints faces at kids' parties to earn extra money.  The equation <m>M(f)=2.5f+12</m> represents the relationship between the money <m>M</m> she makes after painting <m>f</m> faces.  Alejandra wants to buy a new pair of Uggs that cost $119.50.  How many faces does she need to paint?</cell>
        <cell> </cell>
        <cell>---</cell>
